From 72113635ee69f5d28eb92abd8f8fe936a3b9ccae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: duckfamily <156525766+duckfamily@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 02:33:37 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/13] Notify about updates without ever installing them

The upstream updater stays compiled out: its feed serves official Telegram
Desktop packages, and taking one would overwrite this binary with a build
that has none of the hardening.

This notifier only reads. It verifies an Ed25519 signature over the release
metadata against a key compiled in, rejects non-HTTPS URLs and oversized or
slow responses, and at most opens the download link in a browser. It never
downloads or executes code itself.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
